WEBVTT

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:07.250
It possesses enormous power,
and brings endless pleasure

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:11.210
and destruction  to those who are destined.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.970
The Witchblade.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:16.010
At this moment, one woman has awakened.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.460
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.050
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.240
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.530
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.240
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:57.840
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:03.340
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.880
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.390
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:19.310
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:26.530
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:33.530
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.710
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:43.280
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.940
"Reciprocity"

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.030
I got so many stories that
I don't know what to ask first.

00:01:56.110 --> 00:02:01.700
'Kay, Masamune-san?
No hedging around this time.

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:08.410
Please. Leave it 'til tomorrow.
Somewhere without Rihoko...

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:13.420
Well, that's fine.
But you'd better not run away.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:18.130
This is our first home!
As if I'd lose it on account of you!

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.180
I'm lookin' forward to tomorrow!

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:37.940
Oh, Riko... You worked
so hard to clean up for me...

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.040
Is the shop closed?

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:56.630
As long as I'm up, we're open.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.340
Kahlúa and milk, please.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.840
You're such a kid.

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:06.100
I like it! What's wrong with that?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:16.940
You call yourself a do-it-all handyman,
but what exactly do you do?

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:21.030
Leaving your girl alone all night like that...

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:26.030
Everything I can. If it
means I can be with her.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:32.580
Well, she's way more "with-it" than you are.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:36.960
Don't I know that.
Maybe she takes after her father.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.840
What happened to him?

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.840
Who knows? I don't remember.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:46.850
You don't remember?

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:51.810
I don't remember anything
before the Great Quake.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:55.520
Without my maternity record book,
I wouldn't even know my name.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:59.940
And it'd be awkward if he showed
up now that I don't remember him.

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:07.030
People lost so much in the Great Earthquake...

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.240
I guess your memory is one of those things...

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.790
Yeah.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:15.120
That's a nice photo.

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:19.800
That Tozawa kid took it.
Eh?! He did?!

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:27.090
Yup! I discovered him myself,
but all he does is go after lousy scoops.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:31.680
You're absolutely right!
Just who does he think he is?!

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:39.190
No fair! You should've said you were
drinking with Masamune-Chan!

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.530
Chou-san, my name is...

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:44.400
So, what're you having, Masamune-Chan?

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:46.490
Missy, gimme my bottle of potato shoChu

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:52.080
Your bottle?! It's not like
your name is written on my booze...

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:54.250
Oh, come on.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:59.500
Naomi-bou! Come, sit! Want your
usual hot milk? Some cow juice?

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:01.920
Yes!

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.970
Oh, Michael, perfect timing!

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:10.050
Let's drink! We'll have an all-night fever!

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:19.060
If one comes out, then !

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:24.230
Oh! Tozawa-Chan! Drink with us!

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:26.900
No thanks, not tonight.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:31.950
What? Can't hold your liquor? What's the deal?

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:36.660
Hey, don't forget our promise tomorrow!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:40.920
No! No! No! Not unless you drink with us!

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.550
No! No! No!
Look at you...

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:50.300
No, Michael. Today's not...

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:52.550
Oh, all right.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:54.850
I know what it feels like to wanna get drunk...

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.520
'Kay, down the hatch!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:00.270
Oh, great! Go for it, Masamune-Chan!

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.940
Let's keep it goin'!
Ah! One more, please!

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:08.780
Masamune-Chan prepares
for another drink! Drink up!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:16.080
This is a message from Father.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:19.830
Regarding Tsuzuki Shiori, my sadness runs deep.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:24.500
I await an investigation and report
into why this happened.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:27.050
This goes for the Witchblade as well.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:29.550
Furthermore, Father is a bit put out

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:34.220
because there has been no
explanation directly from you.

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:35.350
That is all.

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:54.780
Hey! Not again! Stinky cigarettes
spoil our place's classiness!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.830
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:01.000
Please...

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.920
Please say it.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.670
Who's there?

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:10.630
"I wish upon a star that
my love reaches you..."

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:25.110
Mom, wake up! It's time for breakfast, Mom!

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:30.110
My head hurts... I feel awful...

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:37.030
Ugh! You drank too much again!
I told you to be more careful!

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:40.290
I was careful, up to a point...

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.750
You're hopeless...

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:48.000
I'm going to the sale at the supermarket.
I'll get you some medicine!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.590
'Kay... Thanks...

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:03.600
Come in... It's open...

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:12.240
Hey, Masamune...

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:19.990
You promised. Talk to me.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:23.790
About what?

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.250
Don't play dumb.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.550
Tell me, what the hell's going on?

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.840
That thing you changed into... what is it?

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:36.380
Why ask?

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:43.850
What do you think?! This is something big.
I'll have lots of buyers...

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.350
You'd go public?

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:50.150
I'm willing to pay you, of course.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:05.040
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:09.130
I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:13.920
Hey, now! I have proof, clear as night and day!

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:16.470
You're gonna deny it now?!

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:18.680
That isn't me.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.800
Hey, now!

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:24.350
No idea what you're talking about at all!

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:25.680
Why, you !

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:27.890
No clue!

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:29.770
It's not me!

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.160
I'll be back!

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.500
Code 09 in the Chuo Building in Shinjuku.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:54.960
Squad #03, head to the scene immediately.

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.050
Detain any passersby and witnesses.

00:09:58.550 --> 00:09:59.840
I'm back!

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.430
Will you gimme a break?!

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:04.390
You're a do-it-all handyman, right?

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:06.180
I got a job for ya!

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:18.110
I expect you to work hard for me.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.030
No complaints as long as I pay you, right?

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:21.950
Of course.

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:34.130
She was fine yesterday. How could
she end up like this in one night?

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:38.090
The method's different,
but it's similar to the others.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:40.430
It's the same perp?

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.550
Not necessarily, but...

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:46.390
Dammit! I was about to make
the connection from the victims!

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:48.930
Yuck! Talk about gross!

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:51.940
Could've been another of those monsters!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:58.650
I've been following
these unimaginable killings.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:03.910
And just when I thought I had
a solid lead, I saw you like that.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.330
I will find out what's going on here!

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:12.040
Tozawa! How'd you get in there?!

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.330
What about you, Detective Nakata?

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:18.670
Lording it over there... it's rubbing
the other detectives the wrong way!

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:21.880
Shut up! You want another ass-kicking?!

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:24.680
Whoops! Another time, maybe!

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:26.550
Damn him...

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:31.310
Detective Nakata is the lead
detective in the cases I'm following.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:33.400
He's a real asshole.

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.900
You take photos like those and sell them?

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:40.070
Something wrong with that?

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:44.110
You talk all big, but do you
enjoy doing things like that?

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:48.950
What about you? Is it fun?

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:53.460
I said I don't know anything.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.040
I see...

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:02.170
It's his car. Let's give him a warm hello.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:08.100
Been a long time...

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:10.180
...Tozawa.

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:13.020
Have we met before?

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:15.900
One year ago, you sold photos
of a very valuable client,

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:19.520
going into a hotel with a woman, to a magazine.

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:21.990
Oh... Now that you mention it...

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:26.610
We got a severe scolding that
our security was too weak...

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:31.660
Yeah? But those photos didn't sell for much.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:34.910
The guy just wasn't important enough.
What?!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.630
Hey, hey! I'll apologize!

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:42.050
Masamune, take the envelope
out of the dashboard!

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:42.960
Hurry.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:50.760
You're quick to understand.
I'm used to it, y'know?

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.310
It's not here.

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:55.520
No, it's in there!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.150
Close the door!
Tozawa! Hey!

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:04.070
Do you do this often?!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.740
Just once in a while.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:09.910
Damn nuisance!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.500
H-Hey, don't cause an accident!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.960
If you don't want an accident,
tell me about that night.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.330
At a time like this?!

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:35.560
I... I...

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:44.280
Damn! Where'd he go?!

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.080
We'd better lay low for a bit longer.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.500
Why don't you go to the police?

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:02.920
No need for that. They're too busy
to be chasing hoodlums like that.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.630
I wish you were busy, too.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.380
No way.

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:08.760
Why?!

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:13.050
Isn't it obvious? Who'd keep quiet
after finding a scoop like this?!

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:17.100
I see! In that case, I don't know anything.

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:21.900
Hey, now. This is you in the photo.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:25.900
Deny it all you want,
but once I get this in a magazine...

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.780
Stop!

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.240
It's easy to make copies of those, y'know.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:35.410
Please stop... I don't want Riko to know.

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.040
Please...

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:42.420
Well, I understand, but...

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:52.590
Sir, I sent the remains of the Neo-Gene
who self-destructed to the lab.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:55.140
This is the data for the next
Board of Directors' meeting.

00:14:56.180 --> 00:15:00.350
Is it true that the Witchblade
ultimately destroys its wielders?

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:02.900
If past records are true.

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:07.110
So it'll destroy Masane-san too?
The lab will investigate that.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.780
If it's true though, I feel sorry for her.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:14.780
The Witchblade is on the agenda for discussion.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:19.120
The director of the Bio Section
pressured to have it included...

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:21.210
You mean Wadou?

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:26.960
He really sees you as his enemy.
It may get ugly in there.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.630
Arguments with him really do get ugly.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:33.260
He doesn't give up, does he?

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:36.800
Do you know what he was called in college?

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:39.970
"Gum Stuck to a Shoe."

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.980
They were right.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.270
Sure is boring.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.230
I'll say.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:54.030
Mariko-san told me... You have amnesia?

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:58.280
Yes... I didn't even
remember giving birth to Riko.

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.910
I'm amazed you get through each day.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:05.170
It was tough... Especially at first.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.960
But we're family. Things work out somehow.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:18.810
Say... I like your photograph.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:19.930
Huh?!

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.850
The one in Mariko-san's shop.

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:28.230
Oh, that. Can't take
pictures like that no more.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:32.610
In the passion of youth,
I sold all my possessions

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:35.990
and went on a photography journey.

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:40.540
I came home feeling I had enough experience.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:44.830
But the first ones I wanted
to show my photos to...

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:50.250
...my teacher, my family,
my girlfriend... all had died.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:54.300
I couldn't cry or scream
from the irony of it all...

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:59.760
But when I snapped out of it,
all I had was my camera in hand.

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:05.640
All of myself is buried in that rubble.

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:07.980
Anyway, that's it.

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:14.860
Mariko-san said that everyone
lost something in that Great Quake.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.240
That's for sure.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.280
We're the same.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:24.080
Damned right. That's why you
should tell me about that stuff.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.790
Huh?! Why's that?!

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.540
Work is work!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:32.960
Geez! You spoiled that camaraderie just now!

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:36.420
A normal person would say,
"Here, lean on me and have a good cry!"

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:40.680
Hah! Stupid! That's sentimental crap!

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.140
So hurry up and talk!

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:46.020
No way! I'll never, ever tell you!

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:49.100
What is it?

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:52.980
Please...

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:54.860
Please say,

00:17:54.940 --> 00:18:00.110
"I wish upon a star
that my love reaches you..."
What the hell?!

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.700
Damn! I wasn't paying attention!

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.870
It's dangerous to stay inside!
You think?!

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:10.080
Please, say it!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:13.500
"I wish upon a star that "
Huh? It usually activates on its own...

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:16.510
What now?! You gonna do something?!

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:20.050
It's not transforming!
Huh?!

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:23.260
"...that my love reaches you..."

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:25.600
Run!
Yeah!

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:40.450
Please say it! "I wish upon a star "

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:44.490
Oh, crap!
"...that my love reaches you..."

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:47.120
Hey, Masamune! You alright?!

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.960
Tozawa... let's make a deal!

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.630
Huh?! What're you talkin' about?!

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:58.090
I'll let you photograph me!
But I want to tell Rihoko myself!

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.550
So don't go public until then!

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:03.970
How long?
At least a year.

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:04.680
Too long!

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:08.060
You can wait that long!

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:09.890
You won't be sorry!

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.980
All right, one year! That's all!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:15.150
Then it's a deal!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:31.080
Help me...

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:34.250
I can't stand it anymore!

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:42.680
He got away!

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:45.050
He's different from the others...

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:48.850
What could it be?
Something feels really wrong...

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:53.100
Let's see... Did I forget anything?

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:56.360
Thank you!
Got that, and that.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.230
Okay! All done!

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:09.740
Hello.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:16.330
Umm... did you want something?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:21.590
Not really. Do you want
a reason why I'm here?

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:28.680
Umm, my mom is waiting for me.

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:31.100
I see. Your mom, huh?

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:33.180
Well, goodbye!

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:35.940
Is that how it is?

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.190
Such a jalopy.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:45.070
What?! This is my beloved car!

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:47.950
Mom!

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.370
Riko!

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:54.870
Huh? Why are you with Tozawa-Chan, Mom?

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:58.170
Your mom was helping me with work.

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:05.260
Be careful, Mom!
Tozawa-Chan is out to get you!

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:08.260
Yeah! Better be careful!
Better be careful!

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:12.100
Hey, now! What kind of family are you?!

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:15.270
Mom! Umm, just now...

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:16.440
Huh?

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:21.070
No, it's nothing.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.110
Oh, I bought you medicine!

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.990
Oh, thank you!

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:30.620
"...my... my love reaches you..."

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:35.000
No... I don't want to anymore!

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:15.970
Say, Mom, there sure are
lots of people in Tokyo!

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:18.020
We haven't been here long,

00:23:18.100 --> 00:23:19.680
but I have so many friends!

00:23:19.770 --> 00:23:22.850
Chou-san, Mariko-san,
Naomi-chan, Michael...

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:25.110
Should I include Tozawa-chan, too?

00:23:25.190 --> 00:23:27.110
And I don't know her name,

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:29.900
but I often run into this pretty lady!

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:33.490
Oh, and I met a nice man at the park!

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:36.030
He's going to buy a new house soon!

00:23:36.120 --> 00:23:40.160
I hope we can buy a cute
little house someday, too!
